    skos:prefLabel 'dioxins and dioxin-like compounds'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A mixture of dioxins and compounds with dioxin-like properties. It includes the compound 1,4 dioxin plus 75 congeners of polychlorinated dibenzo-p-dioxins (PCDDs or simply dioxins) derived from dibenzo-p-dioxin plus 10 isomers of polychlorinated dibenzofurans (PCDFs), or furans, derived from dibenzofuran plus 12 congeners of polychlorinated/polybrominated biphenyls (PCBs/PBBs), derived from biphenyl.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S27::CS003783'^^xsd:string .
